        "category": "class",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p>Your magic protects the delicate lattice of your <em>spell gems</em> from damage so they can be used more than once. If your next action is to Cast a Spell from a <em>spell gem</em>, instead of being destroyed, the spell gem becomes a temporary item that can't be sold and lasts only until you use it again or the next time you make your daily preparations (whichever comes first). If your next action is to Cast a Spell from a <em>spell chip</em> that has already been used once today, it becomes broken on a failure (but is still destroyed on a critical failure).</p>"
        },
